ernment and their decision  to abolish the warlord system which was  helping to keep the world in balance he  talks about the marines being absolutely  confident  in their new power to deal with pirates  i love the political struggles and  maneuvering that happens in one piece  the marines seemingly have upped their  power and so kaido  ups his power he tells his men not to  worry since they are allied with another  yonko crew now  and are together going after the ancient  weapons  the weapons are game changers and world  enders we got pluton  a battleship poseidon which manifests as  the mermaid  shirahoshi who can control sea kings and  uranus which we know the least about so  far you can potentially use  each one of these weapons to rule or  destroy the world so with them big mom  and kaido would be  untouchable such a move makes the  government have to act as well as  everyone else  the question is can the marines use an  ancient weapon right now is that one of  the aces up their sleeves  or will every force begin to rush to get  one for themselves  the fact that there's three definitely  leads me to believe that different  forces will acquire different ones  and that may become its own balance of  power but the two  arguably strongest yonko and their crews  working hard with a one-minded focus to  find the ancient weapons  is a scary thought for any force in the  world it'll be a kick in the pants for  everyone  and arms race of epic proportions and i  said arguably too strong is because they  do have the highest bounties  but again we don't know what shanks is  fully capable of we see that nami  and carrot are not in a good situation  looks like zeus  is back in big mom's hands she's at full  power again  and there is a shared sentiment between  these yonko that if they work together  everything including the one piece will  be theirs a crazy announcement since the  one piece often tends to be this thing  in the background but it's finally  given a sense of urgency here there was  whitebeard who wasn't interested in it  and people like akainu who's not gonna  go for it  but now we have two yonko working  together to get it  a crazy goosebump inducing sense of  urgency comes with this announcement  kaido seems to be aiming for chaos and  fear throughout the world for a world of  violence  rather than wanting freedom like luffy  kaido seems to yearn after a survival of  the fittest kind of world  where he's the top dog then something  truly crazy but not altogether hard to  believe happens  kaido announces plans to take over  everything including the flower capital  as orochi becomes shocked and begins  complaining kaido  slices his head off to people's shock  and big mom's laughter  now perhaps orochi's mythical zone  through abilities will save him  since the yamata no orochi has multiple  heads  and usually when you cut off a hydra's  head for instance  it can grow back or even two can grow  back in its place  so it's too soon to say 100 oroshi is  dead but it seems  clear that he's powerless without  kaido's support no matter what  one of the things that stood out this  whole time was that orochi was just  getting to rule based on kaido's power  when kaido realized that orochi was no  longer needed and he had the power to  intimidate all of his forces into  joining him  he took action we learned that kaido is  a guy who waits until the odds are very  good and then strikes  that alliance definitely didn't end well  and it makes me wonder what will happen  to momonosuke now  would kaido execute him or was he  disgusted with orochi's cowardly idea  from the beginning  remember kaido even untied big mom for a  fair fight albeit he owed her but would  he really execute a tied up child  i'm not so sure as kaido gives orochi's  men the ultimatum of joining him or  dying and excited luffy seeing  momonosuke manages to fall from the  ceiling  down to the ground their confrontation  seems real close at hand right now  kaido continues not noticing luffy  saying that they are preparing for the  biggest world war  clearly showing that oda is making this  bigger than marine ford he's going to  turn wano into the  empire of piracy the flower capital will  be the new onigashima  crazy stuff we then jump to kanjiro and  kiku and others for a second  we see a bloody sword and tears flowing  from kiku's mask  as kaido pro claims that it is the end  of wano  the exact opposite of what odin wanted  clearly this is made to look like kiku  got conjured  a traitor but the way oda shows this he  could be purposely misleading us the  ambiguity  makes for an even more interesting  cliffhanger then as if enough  shocking events haven't taken place  already kaido says that yamato  the person who hates him will be the  shogun of the country newly named new  onigashima onigashima translating to den  of demons in english  yamato is infuriated by this and wants  to fight  and luffy wants to know the quickest way  to momo the shackles are still  on so hopefully luffy will take them off  soon  but wow what a chapter i feel like oda  keeps topping himself with these latest  chapters  and this is without a doubt my favorite  yet in this art i can't wait  to see what happens next let me know  your thoughts on this one and what  you're expecting for the next chapter  but damn oda did not disappoint  after 985 chapters he's got me on the  edge of my seat a genius of his craft  23 years in thank you oda for this  amazing adventure and thank you space  fan for watching yet another review  if you did enjoy it and like seeing  these reviews on the channel the best  thing you can do is smash that like  button and share this video  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell or you will miss  future one-piece reviews and videos as  you wait for future chapters to drop  feel free to check out my one piece  playlist link in the description where  you can find videos about the yonko  war